Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7. Conclusion", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c781bd77-1659-4f93-97f8-18998f568f3b"],

Cell["\<\
We have successfully constructed the local SU(2) gauge theory for the weak \
vector bosons using the Relativity Toolkit. 
By defining the generators of SU(2) with a factor of -i (anti-Hermitian \
generators) to remain consistent with CheckingTheBases.nb, we ensure the \
entire derivation is self-consistent and mathematically rigorous. The \
covariant derivative maps and local gauge transformations adapt naturally to \
this Lie algebra basis, yielding perfect cancellation in the covariance tests.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9c3f1ab0-4ee7-4582-8e0a-2c4ad4a2f0a5"]
}, Open  ]],

